   "text": "{\"sections\":[{\"section\":\"summary\",\"body\":\"Veridia Payments met all three financial covenants for the period ended October 31, 2026. The compliance certificate agrees with the bank's calculation on each one. The main change is a steady narrowing of the Minimum Unrestricted Cash cushion since August, to {{fact:325e2386-52d1-44bd-a92a-b5fd4954210e}} at October month-end, with cash of {{fact:28ab73da-d0c2-4579-a5ff-f07545fb48f7}} against a required {{fact:0aaf58ab-8c61-4ac7-817d-7030666e6bb9}}. This trend raised a low-severity signal that no other signal corroborates, and no work items are open for a decision.\"},{\"section\":\"covenants\",\"body\":\"Minimum Runway was calculated at {{fact:48e5e5af-1bc7-45e2-8def-36c2b0d3c909}} against a required {{fact:c46fb07c-0de6-48b8-899b-1091c35b0750}}, a cushion of {{fact:30a92f6e-edf5-4bac-b9aa-511ba223093c}}. Minimum Unrestricted Cash was {{fact:28ab73da-d0c2-4579-a5ff-f07545fb48f7}} against a required {{fact:0aaf58ab-8c61-4ac7-817d-7030666e6bb9}}, a cushion of {{fact:325e2386-52d1-44bd-a92a-b5fd4954210e}}. Revenue to Plan was {{fact:0bc8c5c3-4c76-49da-a4fb-314399ad0c11}} against a required {{fact:1b628848-71bd-43e1-ae4a-79da50ba8b7b}}, a cushion of {{fact:e2674121-a55c-4637-8c98-159415eaa276}}. Each covenant is compliant. The certificate claims compliance on each, and the reported figures match the bank's calculations.\"},{\"section\":\"risks\",\"body\":\"One low-severity signal fired, for falling covenant headroom on Minimum Unrestricted Cash. The cushion narrowed in each month from August through September to {{fact:325e2386-52d1-44bd-a92a-b5fd4954210e}} at October month-end. The covenant remains met, with cash of {{fact:28ab73da-d0c2-4579-a5ff-f07545fb48f7}} against a {{fact:0aaf58ab-8c61-4ac7-817d-7030666e6bb9}} minimum. No other signal corroborates the trend. A reviewer may wish to look at the direction of cash balances in the coming months. There are no open work items awaiting action.\"}]}",
   "type": "text"
  }
 ],
